==Trivia==
*In spite of being listed second in the Treasure menu, the Plasma Crystal is actually the 10th obtainable Into the Future Treasure.
*For [[April Fools' Jokes|April Fools' Day]] 2017, all the Aqua Crystals and Plasma Crystals from Chapters 2 and 3 had their effects disabled.
